@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2C3E50
    LifeLineBorderColor #2C3E50
    ParticipantBorderColor #2C3E50
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #ECF0F1
}

title Sincronización Reactiva del Tablero: Ciclo de Vida en Cliente (React)

actor "Jugador" as Player
participant "Game.tsx" as View
participant "WebSocketManager" as WSClient
participant "Servidor STOMP" as Server
participant "matchUtil" as Utility

== 1. Carga Inicial y Suscripción ==

Player -> View: Accede a /matches/:matchId/game
activate View

View -> View: useFetchState (Carga inicial vía REST de Match, Players, Tiles y Salmons)

View -> WSClient: initConnection(jwt)
WSClient -> Server: STOMP CONNECT (Cabecera Authorization: Bearer <jwt>)
Server --> WSClient: STOMP CONNECTED

View -> WSClient: addSubscription("/topic/match/update/{matchId}")
View -> WSClient: addSubscription("/topic/tilesAndSalmons/{matchId}")
View -> WSClient: addSubscription("/topic/tiles/place/{matchId}")
View -> WSClient: addSubscription("/topic/tiles/rotation/{matchId}")

== 2. Recepción de Eventos y Renderizado ==

Server -> WSClient: Mensaje STOMP: { matchTiles: [...], salmonMatches: [...] }
WSClient -> View: Invoca callback de suscripción

View -> Utility: buildGridFromSnapshot(matchTiles, salmonMatches)
activate Utility
note right of Utility
  Mapea coordenadas relativas a índices del tablero
  y compone celdas inmutables con losetas y salmones.
end note
Utility --> View: newGrid
deactivate Utility

View -> View: Actualizar estado reactivo local (losetas, salmones, cuadrícula)

View -> Player: Renderiza tablero actualizado

== 3. Cierre de Conexión ==

Player -> View: Abandona partida o desmonta componente
View -> WSClient: deactivate()
WSClient -> Server: STOMP DISCONNECT
deactivate View

@enduml
